  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──円香、そこにいるか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2021006020010,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "はい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100602/2021006020010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "新しいバスタオル、スタッフさんが使ってくれって\r\n……受け取れるかな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2021006020020,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "すみません、今はちょっと",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100602/2021006020020"
  },
  {
    "id": 2021006020030,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "近くに置いておいてください",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100602/2021006020030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\nわかった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0220",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "シャワーの最中にすまなかった\r\nそれじゃ──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0282",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 300
  },
  {
    "id": 2021006020040,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "どうでしたか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100602/2021006020040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0282",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 600
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 2021006020050,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "今日の撮影",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100602/2021006020050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "正直、こんなに太陽が似合うと思わなかった──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "って、カメラマンさんが喜んでいたよ\r\nいやその言い方もどうかと思うが",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "彼にとっては最高の評価みたいだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2021006020060,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "そうですか\r\nカメラマンさんが",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100602/2021006020060"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "id": 2021006020070,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "で、あなたの評価は？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100602/2021006020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ん……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すまん、実は別の仕事で急な連絡があって、\r\n見られなかったんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2021006020080,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "そうですよね\r\nどこにもいなかった",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100602/2021006020080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あ、ああ……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でも、席を外している間に終わるくらい\r\n順調だったってことだから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ありがとうな、お疲れ様",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2500
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "1188",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 2021006020090,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "…………あえて",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100602/2021006020090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2021006020100,
    "speaker": "円香",
    "text": "見ないようにしたわけではない、ってことですね",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202100602/2021006020100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え？　ああ、そりゃあ……\r\n本当はちゃんと立ち会いたかったよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
